        "# Descriptor\n",
        "\n",
        "A descriptor is an object that customizes attribute access through methods such as `__get__`, `__set__`, or `__delete__`. Properties and bound methods use the descriptor protocol.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-descriptor)"
      ]
    }
